SUMMARY:Mary Oliver: Saved by the Beauty of the World
LOCATION:MUBI Microcinema at Vidiots\, 4884 Eagle Rock Blvd\, Los Angeles\,
  CA 90041
URL:https://vidiotsfoundation.org/purchase/4437173/
DESCRIPTION:Online tickets are sold out or limited.\n\nRun time: 91 min | F
 ormat: Digital\n\nSeries: Additional Shows\, Groundbreaking Non-Fiction\, 
 In the MUBI Microcinema\, Special Guests in Attendance\n\nCelebrated best-
 selling poet\, Pulitzer Prize-winner\, lover of dogs and long walks in the
  woods\, openly queer but intensely private\, Oliver was America’s unlik
 ely contemporary mystic\, stalking the ponds and forests of Cape Cod for n
 early fifty years in order to open herself – and her readers – to the 
 known and unknowable world.\nFeaturing a conversation with filmmaker Sasha
  Waters after the August 12th screening!\n\nTickets: https://vidiotsfounda
 tion.org/purchase/4437173/\n\nDetails: https://vidiotsfoundation.org/movie
 s/mary-oliver-saved-by-the-beauty-of-the-world/
STATUS:TENTATIVE
END:VEVENT
